{% doc %}
  @prompt
    Create a "How It Works" section directly below the hero banner using the native Dawn theme design language. The section should feel clean, premium, spacious, and editorial with plenty of white space. Avoid bright colors, gradients, or busy backgrounds.
    Section Layout
    Center all content.
    At the top include a small uppercase eyebrow:
    HOW IT WORKS
    Below it, a large serif heading:
    Three simple steps to better cookie days
    Below the heading add a short supporting sentence:
    Freshly baked. Carefully packed. Delivered ready to enjoy.
    Three Column Layout
    Create three equal-width columns with generous spacing between them.
    Each column should contain:
    Step Number
    Display a small terracotta-colored circle containing:
    1
    2
    3
    Step One
    Use a simple outlined shipping box icon.
    Heading:
    Choose Your Box
    Body:
    Pick the perfect size for your craving.
    Below the text display three small outlined pills:
    📦 Treat Yourself (4)
    📦 Signature Box (6)
    📦 Gather Box (12)
    Step Two
    Use a simple cookie icon.
    Heading:
    Fill It With Favorites
    Body:
    Mix and match Signature Favorites and seasonal flavors.
    Below this display four small circular cookie thumbnails in a horizontal row.
    Below the thumbnails include a subtle text link:
    View all flavors
    Step Three
    Use a simple heart icon.
    Heading:
    Savor the Moment
    Body:
    Freshly baked, carefully packed, and ready to make an ordinary day a little sweeter.
    Below the text display a small rounded image of an open Mrs. Davids cookie box.
    Connect the Steps
    Place subtle terracotta-colored arrows between each column to visually guide visitors from left to right.
    Call to Action
    Center a large primary button beneath the three steps:
    Build Your Box
    Use the site's primary brand color for the button.
    Styling
    Match Shopify Dawn theme styling.
    Use the site's serif heading font and sans-serif body font.
    Keep the background white.
    Use soft beige or cream accents behind the icons.
    Use thin line icons instead of filled illustrations.
    Maintain generous vertical spacing.
    Mobile layout should stack the three steps vertically while preserving the numbering.
    Design Goal
    The section should communicate that ordering is effortless while reinforcing the premium, intentional experience of Mrs. Davids Creations. It should feel elegant, trustworthy, and refined rather than playful or cartoonish. The primary goal is to encourage visitors to click "Build Your Box."
    
{% enddoc %}
{% assign ai_gen_id = block.id | replace: '_', '' | downcase %}

{% style %}
  .ai-how-it-works-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    background-color: {{ block.settings.background_color }};
    padding: {{ block.settings.padding_top }}px 0 {{ block.settings.padding_bottom }}px;
  }

  .ai-how-it-works-container-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    max-width: {{ block.settings.container_width }}px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 20px;
  }

  .ai-how-it-works-header-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: {{ block.settings.header_spacing }}px;
  }

  .ai-how-it-works-eyebrow-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: {{ block.settings.eyebrow_size }}px;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: {{ block.settings.eyebrow_color }};
    margin-bottom: 16px;
    font-weight: 400;
  }

  .ai-how-it-works-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: {{ block.settings.heading_size }}px;
    line-height: 1.2;
    color: {{ block.settings.heading_color }};
    margin: 0 0 20px;
    font-weight: 400;
  }

  .ai-how-it-works-subheading-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: {{ block.settings.subheading_size }}px;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: {{ block.settings.text_color }};
    max-width: 600px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .ai-how-it-works-steps-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: {{ block.settings.column_gap }}px;
    margin-bottom: {{ block.settings.cta_spacing }}px;
    align-items: start;
  }

  .ai-how-it-works-step-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    text-align: center;
    position: relative;
  }

  .ai-how-it-works-step-number-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: {{ block.settings.step_number_size }}px;
    height: {{ block.settings.step_number_size }}px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background-color: {{ block.settings.step_number_bg }};
    color: {{ block.settings.step_number_color }};
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    margin: 0 auto 24px;
    font-size: {{ block.settings.step_number_font_size }}px;
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  .ai-how-it-works-icon-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: {{ block.settings.icon_size }}px;
    height: {{ block.settings.icon_size }}px;
    margin: 0 auto 24px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    background-color: {{ block.settings.icon_bg_color }};
    border-radius: 50%;
  }

  .ai-how-it-works-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: {{ block.settings.icon_size | times: 0.5 }}px;
    height: {{ block.settings.icon_size | times: 0.5 }}px;
    stroke: {{ block.settings.icon_color }};
    fill: none;
    stroke-width: 1.5;
  }

  .ai-how-it-works-step-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: {{ block.settings.step_heading_size }}px;
    line-height: 1.3;
    color: {{ block.settings.heading_color }};
    margin: 0 0 12px;
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  .ai-how-it-works-step-text-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: {{ block.settings.step_text_size }}px;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: {{ block.settings.text_color }};
    margin: 0 0 20px;
  }

  .ai-how-it-works-pills-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 8px;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .ai-how-it-works-pill-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 6px;
    padding: 8px 16px;
    border: 1px solid {{ block.settings.pill_border_color }};
    border-radius: 20px;
    font-size: 13px;
    color: {{ block.settings.text_color }};
    background-color: {{ block.settings.background_color }};
  }

  .ai-how-it-works-thumbnails-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    gap: 8px;
    justify-content: center;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }

  .ai-how-it-works-thumbnail-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: 50px;
    height: 50px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    overflow: hidden;
    border: 1px solid {{ block.settings.pill_border_color }};
  }

  .ai-how-it-works-thumbnail-{{ ai_gen_id }} img {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
  }

  .ai-how-it-works-link-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: 14px;
    color: {{ block.settings.text_color }};
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-underline-offset: 3px;
  }

  .ai-how-it-works-link-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover {
    opacity: 0.7;
  }

  .ai-how-it-works-box-image-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 200px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    border-radius: 8px;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .ai-how-it-works-box-image-{{ ai_gen_id }} img {
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    display: block;
  }

  .ai-how-it-works-arrow-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: absolute;
    top: 120px;
    right: -{{ block.settings.column_gap | divided_by: 2 }}px;
    transform: translateX(50%);
    width: 24px;
    height: 24px;
    stroke: {{ block.settings.arrow_color }};
    fill: none;
    stroke-width: 1.5;
  }

  .ai-how-it-works-step-{{ ai_gen_id }}:last-child .ai-how-it-works-arrow-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: none;
  }

  .ai-how-it-works-cta-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    text-align: center;
  }

  .ai-how-it-works-button-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 16px 40px;
    background-color: {{ block.settings.button_bg_color }};
    color: {{ block.settings.button_text_color }};
    font-size: {{ block.settings.button_font_size }}px;
    text-decoration: none;
    border: 1px solid {{ block.settings.button_bg_color }};
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: all 0.2s ease;
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  .ai-how-it-works-button-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover {
    background-color: {{ block.settings.button_hover_bg }};
    border-color: {{ block.settings.button_hover_bg }};
  }

  @media screen and (max-width: 989px) {
    .ai-how-it-works-steps-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 60px;
    }

    .ai-how-it-works-arrow-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      display: none;
    }

    .ai-how-it-works-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: {{ block.settings.heading_size | times: 0.7 }}px;
    }
  }

  @media screen and (max-width: 749px) {
    .ai-how-it-works-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      padding: {{ block.settings.padding_top | times: 0.7 }}px 0 {{ block.settings.padding_bottom | times: 0.7 }}px;
    }

    .ai-how-it-works-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: {{ block.settings.heading_size | times: 0.6 }}px;
    }

    .ai-how-it-works-pills-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      flex-direction: column;
    }
  }
{% endstyle %}

<div class="ai-how-it-works-{{ ai_gen_id }}" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
  <div class="ai-how-it-works-container-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
    <div class="ai-how-it-works-header-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
